        check("①簡版彙總+裁判簽名擋 → 印提示句、回 1", rc == 1 and "簡版彙總" in out and _PPC_ANCHOR_NOTE in out, out[-600:])
        rc, lines, out = _ppc_run(root, stdin, FAKE_NEW="1", FAKE_RCS="home:1,push-summary:2")
        check("②簡版彙總、沒有裁判簽名那筆 → 不印提示句", rc == 1 and "簡版彙總" in out and "裁判檔沒簽名" not in out, out[-600:])
